B. Maia-3 Components & In-Browser Inference Engine (GNU AGPLv3)
The Maia-3 neural network architecture, in-browser forward execution engine
(engine/maia-inbrowser.js, engine/maia-engine.js, engine/maia-worker.js), and weight export
scripts (scripts/export_weights.py) are direct derivations and JavaScript implementations
of the Maia-3 project developed by the Computational Social Science Lab (CSSLab) at the
University of Toronto and Carnegie Mellon University.
- Upstream: https://github.com/CSSLab/maia3 (Commit: 1e13597c42d4858b7cfd7cfdae01e297263364b2)
- Checkpoint: Hugging Face UofTCSSLab/Maia3-5M (Revision: b6559de2398d7140b985f28fd2c19fb5e47ddabe)
- License: GNU Affero General Public License v3.0 (AGPL-3.0)
- Full License Text: LICENSES/AGPL-3.0.txt

C. Stockfish WebAssembly Engine & Wrapper (GNU GPLv3)
The WebAssembly compilation and JavaScript glue wrapper (lib/stockfish.wasm, lib/stockfish-19.js)
originate from the Stockfish.js project by Nathan Rugg and Chess.com, LLC, based on the
official Stockfish chess engine.
- Upstream Stockfish.js: https://github.com/nmrugg/stockfish.js (Tag: v19.0.0, Commit: 9cb3e5066d48f1a35d792afeda36eff37ae60570)
- Upstream Stockfish C++: https://github.com/official-stockfish/Stockfish (Stockfish 19 release)
- License: GNU General Public License v3.0 (GPL-3.0)
- Full License Text: LICENSES/GPL-3.0.txt

